Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:05.02,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 1/8决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:05.02,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}科博利 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(3) {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 霍达尔 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks Beth. Got Flavio here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢贝丝 弗拉维奥来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Got Flavio here. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,That That was absolutely amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,那真是太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:06.52,EN,,0,0,0,,What a great match from start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:06.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,从头到尾都是一场好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Those emotions at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后那种情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you were fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你整个人都燃起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:12.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it. What were you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:12.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟我说说 你当时是什么感受？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Like I said on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚才在场上也这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.88,EN,,0,0,0,,thanks for the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你这番话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:16.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Like I said on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚才在场上也这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I think sometimes you have to remind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候我得提醒自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to myself that I'm really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.84,EN,,0,0,0,,That's what I think today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我就是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I really have a great match today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天打得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:29.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Great level for for a almost 3 hours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,水准很高 打了将近三个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:33.56,EN,,0,0,0,,with the one of the best renowned tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手是巡回赛里最出名的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,He's an incredible guy, incredible player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,他人很棒 球技也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I wish him all the best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我祝他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,for the for the future, but not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,未来一切顺利 但今天不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Got to remind yourself how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,得提醒自己你有多厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Listen, so many things were working well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,听着 你身上很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,都在起作用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Your forehand, your footwork, your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,正手 步法 还有你的拼劲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What was most important for you to come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪一项对你来说最关键
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:48.76,EN,,0,0,0,,through?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能顶过来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:49.16,EN,,0,0,0,,also.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.96,EN,,0,0,0,,all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:57.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I think today the key was the my attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天关键就是我的心态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:00:59.56,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:00:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是在场上的那股劲头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:01.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, my forehand was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 我的正手打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,My serve was better than the other match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球也比上一场更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:06.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and my return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发球也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,But, I think the the way that I fought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得 我在场上拼抢的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court was I think that I did better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我今天做得更好的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:12.92,EN,,0,0,0,,When you hit a forehand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打正手的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.80,EN,,0,0,0,,it it looks like and seems like you're putting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉你是把整个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.04,EN,,0,0,0,,your entire body, mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体 心思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:19.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and soul into that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有灵魂都砸了进去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Like all of your ancestors are going into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,像是把祖先的力量都用上了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时是什么感受？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:25.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I I have to improve also
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 这也是我要改进的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:29.84,EN,,0,0,0,,because I think I leave there all my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我把力气都留在那一拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:32.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and sometimes I think I I have to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候我觉得我该留一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:36.28,EN,,0,0,0,,for for the next point, next next shot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,留给下一分 下一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:39.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I was praying for for some lucky there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时就盼着能有点运气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:46.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You have a great forehand, Flavio. 11 and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的正手真的很棒 弗拉维奥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that I do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这块我还能做得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, when I can hit the forehand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以当我能找到合适的站位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,with the right position,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,去打正手的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I have a good forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的正手是很不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You have a great forehand, Flavio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的正手真的很棒 弗拉维奥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,11 and two now in deciding sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘你现在是十一胜两负
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What is your mindset in those moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种时刻你的心态是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:03.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Keep playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,别的都不想 接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:06.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Believe on myself and keep pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,相信自己 一直往前拼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.20,EN,,0,0,0,,That's what I think and what I what I ask
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是我一直以来的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:14.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to myself to to leave everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是我对自己的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.76,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court until the last point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,一切都留到最后一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And that's what I have to be proud
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是我今天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,of of of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,该为自己骄傲的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You got a new Hulk tattoo earlier this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今年纹了个绿巨人纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're always kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉你总是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of kind of looking at that, pointing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,会看一眼 指一下它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,at that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and it actually gives you superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,它好像真的能给你一种超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:38.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Hulk helped me sometimes and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,绿巨人有时候真能帮到我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I have to make another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还得再纹一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I have to make more and more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要纹更多 更多 更多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So I never ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,根本纹不完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, just completely
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吧 那简直是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Every every week you feel you you you see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一周你都会看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,再多一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:48.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.36,EN,,0,0,0,,If I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Love to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 期待看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see what the next tat's going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,等不及想看下一个纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,会是什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I have no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可没那个时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:55.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So better for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,那对我更好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:56.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Better cuz you're moving
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,更好 因为你要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:57.84,EN,,0,0,0,,on to the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,打下一轮了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.48,EN,,0,0,0,,First quarterfinal here in Cincy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的第一个1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for stopping by the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你来演播桌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:01.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Best of luck going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:01.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你接下来一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:02.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:02.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:05.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Send it back to Pat and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,画面交回给帕特他们
